# rules.pdl (rmmc skin of vox, D137) - copy of @.apps/vox/rules.pdl with the island numbers: the world is 216 x 156 columns (x 0..215, z = desk row 0..155) and 41 levels high (the tallest peak is level 28, vox y 30 with RULE shift 3); hunger is OFF (a rule value, not a code branch).
RULE | world_x_max | 215
RULE | world_y_max | 40
RULE | world_z_max | 155
RULE | reach | 4
RULE | stack_max | 64
RULE | place_needs_support | 1
RULE | move_max | 4
RULE | wait_max_turns | 10000
RULE | turns_move | 1
RULE | turns_mine | 1
RULE | turns_place | 1
RULE | minutes_per_turn | 10
RULE | day_minutes | 1440
RULE | start_minute | 420
RULE | sleep_max_light | 3
RULE | sleep_bed_reach | 3
RULE | sleep_wake_minute | 420
# TOOL | name | power (a swing of the block's tool_best uses that tool's power; any other tool swings at the hand's power)
TOOL | hand | 1
TOOL | shovel | 2
TOOL | axe | 2
TOOL | shears | 2
TOOL | pick | 3
# DAYLIGHT | minute | level 0..15 (linear between rows, integer division toward zero; the sky and rules read this, nothing stores a time of day)
DAYLIGHT | 0 | 2
DAYLIGHT | 300 | 2
DAYLIGHT | 360 | 8
DAYLIGHT | 420 | 15
DAYLIGHT | 1080 | 15
DAYLIGHT | 1140 | 8
DAYLIGHT | 1200 | 2
DAYLIGHT | 1440 | 2
# hunger on manual turns (D110): every spawned actor gains hunger_per_turn on each TURN row (cap hunger_max); at starve_at mine and place refuse (22); EAT lowers hunger by food_<item> and costs turns_eat
RULE | hunger_per_turn | 0
RULE | hunger_max | 40
RULE | starve_at | 30
RULE | turns_eat | 1
RULE | food_apple | 4
RULE | food_bread | 12
# walking (D137; read by vox_op walk and jump): a walk is ONE MOVE row of manhattan length 1 + |dy|, so move_max must be at least 1 + the larger of step_up and fall_max (1 + 3 = 4)
RULE | step_up | 1
# climbing out of water: the shore of a lake is 2 above its shallow bed, so a wader may step up 2
RULE | fall_max | 3
RULE | water_max_depth | 1
RULE | jump_height | 1
RULE | step_up_wade | 2
# crafting (2026-11-25): a station block must be within craft_reach; each craft is one turn
RULE | craft_reach | 2
RULE | turns_craft | 1
# RECIPE | name | out item | out n | in1 | n1 | in2 | n2 | station (- = none)      the out item of a recipe is what the hotbar slot picks: pick the item you want, press C
RECIPE | planks | planks | 4 | wood_side | 1 | - | 0 | -
RECIPE | table | craft_table | 1 | planks | 4 | - | 0 | -
RECIPE | pickaxe | pick | 1 | planks | 3 | - | 0 | craft_table
RECIPE | axe | axe | 1 | planks | 3 | - | 0 | craft_table
RECIPE | shovel | shovel | 1 | planks | 2 | - | 0 | craft_table
# guns (D158, owner 2026-11-27: "give one of their tools to be guns .22, auto/bazooka"): a held item that has a GUN row is FIRED by the use key (b) instead of swung. The ammo is a bag item taken by the SHOT row.
# GUN | name | ammo item | effect (dmg ignite water) | dmg per round | range (cells) | rounds per pull (ammo used) | blast radius | dmg lost per cell of distance | max hardness it can chip | turns per shot | deposit kind (- none)
GUN | pistol22 | bullets   | dmg    | 1 | 24 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 2 | 1 | -
GUN | autogun  | bullets   | dmg    | 1 | 20 | 5 | 0 | 0 | 4 | 1 | -
GUN | bazooka  | rockets   | dmg    | 8 | 30 | 1 | 2 | 2 | 6 | 2 | -
GUN | flamer   | fuel      | ignite | 0 | 6  | 1 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 1 | -
GUN | watergun | waterpack | water  | 0 | 10 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 0 | 1 | water_f3
RULE | indestructible_hardness | 99
RULE | eye_height | 1
RULE | muzzle_height | 0
RULE | pitch_run | 2
# fire and water (D159): a BURN row says what a flammable block (the blocks.pdl flammable column) does on fire: BURN | kind | turns it burns | percent chance per turn that a burning neighbour sets it alight | what it becomes
RULE | fire_seed | 7
RULE | fire_cells_per_turn | 32
RULE | extinguish_char_pct | 50
RULE | flow_cells_per_turn | 16
RULE | water_spread | 3
RULE | water_dry_turns | 8
BURN | wood_side | 6 | 25 | charcoal
BURN | wood_top | 6 | 25 | charcoal
BURN | planks | 5 | 40 | charcoal
BURN | craft_table | 5 | 30 | charcoal
BURN | leaves | 3 | 60 | air
